{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"10867","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10867","key":"MC-112730","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"22/Jan/17 12:55 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>Beacon beams and structure block outlines will render themselves twice per frame if the chunk sector that the block entity is in is in view.<br>\nThis can be observed by the opacity of a beacon beam changing:</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O2JbaI1.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></span></p>\n\n<p>The decreased opacity when looking upward indicates there is only a single render.</p>\n\n<p>As side note this bug was introduced in the fix to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-68247\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-68247\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Beacon Beam disappears while looking upwards from it\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-68247\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Affectedblocks\"></a>Affected blocks</h3>\n<p>Last updated for 1.11.2</p>\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><tt>beacon</tt></li>\n\t<li><tt>structure_block</tt></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Codeanalysis\"></a>Code analysis</h3>\n<p>Based on 1.11.2 decompiled using MCP 9.35 rc1</p>\n\n<p>This happens because the method <tt>net.minecraft.client.renderer.RenderGlobal.renderEntities(Entity, ICamera, float)</tt> first renders all tile entities and then all \"global\" tile entities. These are in the set <tt>net.minecraft.client.renderer.RenderGlobal.setTileEntities</tt> because their overridden method <tt>net.minecraft.client.renderer.tileentity.TileEntitySpecialRenderer.isGlobalRenderer(T)</tt> returns <tt>true</tt>.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"22/Jan/17 10:19 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"19/May/25 8:04 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"19/May/25 8:04 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"Beacon beam and structure block render twice per frame","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"hierarchyLevel":0},"watches":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/MC-112730/watchers","watchCount":1,"isWatching":false},"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":null,"created":"2017-01-22T12:55:16.770-0800","customfield_10050":null,"customfield_10051":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10098","value":"Platform","id":"10098"},"description":{"type":"doc","version":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The bug"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Beacon beams and structure block outlines will render themselves twice per frame if the chunk sector that the block entity is in is in view."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This can be observed by the opacity of a beacon beam changing:"}]},{"type":"mediaSingle","attrs":{"layout":"center"},"content":[{"type":"media","attrs":{"type":"external","url":"https://i.imgur.com/O2JbaI1.gif","height":183,"width":200}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The decreased opacity when looking upward indicates there is only a single render."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"As side note this bug was introduced in the fix to MC-68247"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Affected blocks"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Last updated for 1.11.2"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"beacon","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"structure_block","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Code analysis"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on 1.11.2 decompiled using MCP 9.35 rc1"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This happens because the method "},{"type":"text","text":"net.minecraft.client.renderer.RenderGlobal.renderEntities(Entity, ICamera, float)","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" first renders all tile entities and then all \"global\" tile entities. These are in the set "},{"type":"text","text":"net.minecraft.client.renderer.RenderGlobal.setTileEntities","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" because their overridden method "},{"type":"text","text":"net.minecraft.client.renderer.tileentity.TileEntitySpecialRenderer.isGlobalRenderer(T)","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" returns "},{"type":"text","text":"true","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},"customfield_10054":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10023","value":"Confirmed","id":"10023"},"fixVersions":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api